#: arts.cpp:549
msgid " <h1>Sound System</h1> Here you can configure aRts, KDE's sound server. This program not only allows you to hear your system sounds while simultaneously listening to an MP3 file or playing a game with background music. It also allows you to apply different effects to your system sounds and provides programmers with an easy way to achieve sound support."
msgstr "<h1>Cysawd Sain</h1>Yma gallwch ffurfweddu aRts, gweinydd sain KDE. Galluoga'r rhaglen hon i chi glywed eich seiniau cysawd tra'n gwrando ar ffeil MP3 neu chwarae gêm â cherddoriaeth cefndir. Galluoga i chi hefyd weithredu effeithiau gwahanol ar eich seiniau cysawd, a darpera ffordd hawdd o gynnal sain i raglennwyr."

