#: rc.cpp:19
msgid " This controls the level of messages that are output by the sound server. Only messages at the selected level and above will be reported."
msgstr "Rheola hwn lefel y negeseuon sy'n allbwn i'r gweinydd sain. Dim ond negeseuon y lefel dewisiedig neu uwch yr adroddir."

#: rc.cpp:20
msgid "&Start aRts soundserver on KDE startup"
msgstr "&Cychwyn gweinydd sain aRts ar gychwyn KDE"

#: rc.cpp:21
msgid " If this option is enabled, the arts soundserver will be started on KDE startup. Recommended if you want sound."
msgstr "Os yw'r dewisiad yma'n alluog, cychwynnir y gweinydd sain arts ar gychwyn KDE. Yn argymelledig os ydych am sain."

